OL,7,FReform UK leader Nigel Farage denies
OL,8,Fwrongdoing over foreign donor talks as
OL,9,Fhe faces questions from Laura
OL,10,FKuenssberg
OL,12,FFarage says he "frankly wasn't
OL,13,Flistening" during a conversation with
OL,14,Fan undercover reporter - he earlier
OL,15,Fsaid his party had "done nothing wrong"
OL,17,FReform's autumn conference was
OL,18,Fovershadowed by the departures of two
OL,19,Fsenior officials, after undercover
OL,20,Ffilming broadcast by Channel 4 News
OL,21,Fappeared to show them discussing how to
OL,22,Fget around electoral law
